3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：此丹陽在漢中。劉昭曰：南郡枝江縣有丹陽聚，卽秦破楚處。李𡌴輿地紀勝曰：丹陽在今歸州秭歸縣東八里屈沱楚王城是也。余按楚遣屈匄伐秦，秦發兵逆擊之，枝江之丹陽則距郢逼近，秭歸之丹陽則不當秦、楚之路。索隱因下文遂取漢中，卽謂丹陽在漢中，皆非也。此丹陽謂丹水之陽。班志：丹水出上洛冢嶺山，東至析入鈞水，其水蓋在弘農丹水、析兩縣之間，武關之外也。秦、楚交戰當在此水之陽。楚師旣敗，秦師乘勝取上庸路西入以收漢中，其勢易矣。索，山客翻。𡌴，與埴同。屈，九勿翻。冢，知隴翻。易，弋豉翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：此丹阳在汉中。刘昭曰：南郡枝江县有丹阳聚，即秦破楚处。李𡌴舆地纪胜曰：丹阳在今归州秭归县东八里屈沱楚王城是也。余按楚遣屈匄伐秦，秦发兵逆击之，枝江之丹阳则距郢逼近，秭归之丹阳则不当秦、楚之路。索隐因下文遂取汉中，即谓丹阳在汉中，皆非也。此丹阳谓丹水之阳。班志：丹水出上洛冢岭山，东至析入钧水，其水盖在弘农丹水、析两县之间，武关之外也。秦、楚交战当在此水之阳。楚师既败，秦师乘胜取上庸路西入以收汉中，其势易矣。索，山客翻。𡌴，与埴同。屈，九勿翻。冢，知陇翻。易，弋豉翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf50-db0e-11ef-baad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf83-db0e-11ef-b598-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"執珪，楚爵也，執珪而朝者也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"执珪，楚爵也，执珪而朝者也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf82-db0e-11ef-b6aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"黃義仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"黄义仲","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf85-db0e-11ef-9cd9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"沔陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"沔阳","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf86-db0e-11ef-8c7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"成固","place_name_jianti_auto":"成固","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf87-db0e-11ef-a2f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新城","place_name_jianti_auto":"新城","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf88-db0e-11ef-a09f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上庸","place_name_jianti_auto":"上庸","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf89-db0e-11ef-9e9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉中郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf8a-db0e-11ef-adad-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自沔陽、成固至新城、上庸，時皆漢中郡之地。釋名曰：郡，羣也，人所羣聚也。黃義仲十三州記曰：郡之言君也。改公侯之封而言君者，至尊也。今郡字，「君」在其左，「邑」在其右，君爲元首，邑以載民，故取名於君，謂之郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自沔阳、成固至新城、上庸，时皆汉中郡之地。释名曰：郡，群也，人所群聚也。黄义仲十三州记曰：郡之言君也。改公侯之封而言君者，至尊也。今郡字，「君」在其左，「邑」在其右，君为元首，邑以载民，故取名于君，谓之郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf84-db0e-11ef-a2a0-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf8f-db0e-11ef-b0be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦孝公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦孝公","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf90-db0e-11ef-ad17-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"藍田縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓝田县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf91-db0e-11ef-a131-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf92-db0e-11ef-b7aa-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藍田縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓝田县","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf93-db0e-11ef-bd02-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf94-db0e-11ef-973d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藍田關","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓝田关","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf95-db0e-11ef-b2db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"藍田縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"蓝田县","start_index":38,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf96-db0e-11ef-a2f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf97-db0e-11ef-a367-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf98-db0e-11ef-9407-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"班志，藍田縣屬京兆，秦孝公置。史記正義曰：藍田縣在雍州東南八十里。從藍田關入藍田縣，時楚襲秦深入。","note_content_jianti_auto":"班志，蓝田县属京兆，秦孝公置。史记正义曰：蓝田县在雍州东南八十里。从蓝田关入蓝田县，时楚袭秦深入。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf8e-db0e-11ef-8322-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf9c-db0e-11ef-b7b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf9d-db0e-11ef-92ce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄧","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf9e-db0e-11ef-8970-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf9f-db0e-11ef-a261-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧國","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓国","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa0-db0e-11ef-b55b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓县","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa1-db0e-11ef-8894-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"南阳郡","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa2-db0e-11ef-99b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"潁川","place_name_jianti_auto":"颍川","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa3-db0e-11ef-9220-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"召陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"召陵县","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa4-db0e-11ef-9c95-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧城","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓城","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa5-db0e-11ef-aa13-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄧城","place_name_jianti_auto":"邓城","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa6-db0e-11ef-845e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"豫州","place_name_jianti_auto":"豫州","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa7-db0e-11ef-9d20-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郾陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"郾陵县","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa8-db0e-11ef-bb25-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"召陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"召陵","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8c65cfa9-db0e-11ef-9099-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鄧，春秋鄧國之地。班志，鄧縣屬南陽郡。杜預曰：潁川召陵縣西有鄧城。括地志曰：故鄧城在豫州郾陵縣東三十五里，所謂在古召陵西十里者也。召，讀曰邵。","note_content_jianti_auto":"邓，春秋邓国之地。班志，邓县属南阳郡。杜预曰：颍川召陵县西有邓城。括地志曰：故邓城在豫州郾陵县东三十五里，所谓在古召陵西十里者也。召，读曰邵。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf9b-db0e-11ef-b6d0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉中郡","place_note":"汉水中上游","resolved_place_entity_id":4939,"start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8c6822bc-db0e-11ef-858b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/战国自取亡","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，不能取偿，身遭囚辱以死。赵以上党之地，代韩受兵，利令智...","context_before":"...孙沮气，孑孑自保，终堕秦计，束手为虏。怀王贪商於六百里，","source_end_index":303,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"1509ccdd-dd12-435e-a66e-d1a5b3e173e1","source_start_index":289,"source_text":"受诈张仪，失其名都，丧其甲士"}],"path":"随笔/卷十/战国自取亡","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又秦昭襄十六年，司马错取邓，封公子悝于邓，此邓城也]。","context_before":"...年，蔡侯、郑伯会于邓。又昭十三年，楚蔡公子干子鹔盟于邓。","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f3cb31fd-7162-5d9f-a01d-4363e5d7a7b1","source_start_index":52,"source_text":"战国时，楚怀王伐秦，败于蓝田。韩、魏闻之，南袭楚至邓。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...关，又东南流经丹水故城，又东南而合于淅水，下流入于均水。","source_end_index":107,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9d405267-107b-546a-8def-2f83f36c5cfb","source_start_index":77,"source_text":"战国赧王三年，秦人大败楚师于丹阳，遂取汉中郡。盖即丹水之阳矣"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/八、南阳府（卷五十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"又沛公与秦军战于蓝田南，败之。汉建安十七年，马超余众屯蓝...","context_before":"...书》：梁惠成王三年，秦子向命为蓝君。盖向之故邑，后置县。","source_end_index":79,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b1a94414-3a3e-5734-ac4d-159cabbd469d","source_start_index":49,"source_text":"周赧王三年，楚怀王因丹阳之败，悉国兵复袭秦，战于蓝田，大败。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"1春，秦師及楚戰于丹陽，楚師大敗，斬甲士八萬，虜屈匄及列侯、執珪七十餘人，遂取漢中郡。楚王悉發國內兵以復襲秦，戰於藍田，楚師大敗。韓、魏聞楚之困，南襲楚，至鄧。楚人聞之，乃引兵歸，割兩城以請平于秦。","content_fanyi":"春季，秦、楚两国军队在丹阳交战，楚军大败，秦军斩杀甲士八万人，俘虏了将军屈匄以及列侯、执珪等有爵位者七十余人，随后夺取汉中郡。楚王征发国内全部兵力再次袭击秦国，双方在蓝田交战，楚军又大败。韩、魏两国听说楚国陷入困境，便向南袭击楚国，到达邓县。楚军听到这个消息，便撤军回国，割让两座城邑向秦国求和。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，秦师及楚战于丹阳，楚师大败，斩甲士八万，虏屈匄及列侯、执珪七十余人，遂取汉中郡。楚王悉发国内兵以复袭秦，战于蓝田，楚师大败。韩、魏闻楚之困，南袭楚，至邓。楚人闻之，乃引兵归，割两城以请平于秦。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":246,"number":1,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 三年 / 第 1 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c65cf4f-db0e-11ef-b693-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-312},"tongjian_id":"8c65cf4f-db0e-11ef-b693-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"漢中郡","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉中郡","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"958b8b47-db0e-11ef-9b4b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"958b8b48-db0e-11ef-bf93-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"漢中郡，在洛陽西千九百九十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"汉中郡，在洛阳西千九百九十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"958b8b46-db0e-11ef-80d4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郡有戶曹，主民戶、祠祀、農桑。郃，曷閤翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郡有户曹，主民户、祠祀、农桑。郃，曷合翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"958b8b49-db0e-11ef-8e40-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"翹，舉也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"翘，举也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4a-db0e-11ef-8d84-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"潘岳","people_name_jianti_auto":"潘岳","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4c-db0e-11ef-9442-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"三辅","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4d-db0e-11ef-9356-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安城","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安城","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4e-db0e-11ef-94c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"東都","place_name_jianti_auto":"东都","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4f-db0e-11ef-a7c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"958b8b50-db0e-11ef-816f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"槐里","place_name_jianti_auto":"槐里","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"958b8b51-db0e-11ef-90c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"958b8b52-db0e-11ef-b578-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"958b8b53-db0e-11ef-be3b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"潘岳關中記曰：三輔舊治長安城中，長吏各居其縣治民。東都之後，扶風出治槐里，馮翊出治高陵。","note_content_jianti_auto":"潘岳关中记曰：三辅旧治长安城中，长吏各居其县治民。东都之后，扶风出治槐里，冯翊出治高陵。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"958b8b4b-db0e-11ef-ae26-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"958b8b45-db0e-11ef-866e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"hé","source_anchor_text":"吏戶曹李郃諫曰竇將","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":28,"text":"郃","tongjian_id":"83a544fe-7106-5331-856f-3b728e40d608"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"漢中郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉中郡","resolved_place_entity_id":4939,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"958b8b57-db0e-11ef-b13c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"9初，竇憲納妻，天下郡國皆有禮慶。漢中郡亦當遣吏，戶曹李郃諫曰：「竇將軍椒房之親，不修德禮而專權驕恣，危亡之禍，可翹足而待；願明府一心王室，勿與交通。」太守固遣之，郃不能止，請求自行，許之。郃遂所在遲留以觀其變，行至扶風而憲就國。凡交通者皆坐免官，漢中太守獨不與焉。","content_fanyi":"当初，窦宪娶妻时，天下各郡、各封国都送来礼物表示祝贺。汉中郡也应当派官吏前往送礼，户曹李郃劝谏太守说：“窦将军身为太后至亲，不修德行和礼法，反而专权骄横，危亡的祸患很快就会到来；希望明府一心忠于朝廷，不要与他交往。”太守执意派人前往，李郃无法阻止，就请求自己前去送礼，太守答应了。李郃于是所到之处都逗留拖延，以观察事态变化，走到扶风郡时，窦宪已被遣回自己的封国。凡是与窦宪往来交结的官员，都被论罪免官，唯独汉中郡太守没有受到牵连。","content_jianti_auto":"9初，窦宪纳妻，天下郡国皆有礼庆。汉中郡亦当遣吏，户曹李郃谏曰：「窦将军椒房之亲，不修德礼而专权骄恣，危亡之祸，可翘足而待；愿明府一心王室，勿与交通。」太守固遣之，郃不能止，请求自行，许之。郃遂所在迟留以观其变，行至扶风而宪就国。凡交通者皆坐免官，汉中太守独不与焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3816,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十八 (漢紀四十) / 孝和皇帝下 / 永元四年 / 第 13 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"958b8b45-db0e-11ef-866e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":92},"tongjian_id":"958b8b45-db0e-11ef-866e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":2},"place_name":"漢中郡"},"message":"success","success":true}